ore looking for solutions? Share an example of a time when a poorly defined problem led to challenges and how a clearer definition could have improved ...</div></div><div class="makeStylescontentItemContextArea-0-2-326"><button class="MuiButtonBaseroot-0-2-365 MuiIconButtonroot-0-2-356 makeStylesoverflowMenu-0-2-355" tabindex="0" type="button" id="content-item-overflow-menu-button-_55105956_1" title="More options for Wk 2 Discussion: Problem-Solving and Critical Thinking [due Thurs]" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More options for Wk 2 Discussion: Problem-Solving and Critical Thinking [due Thurs]" aria-haspopup="true" data-analytics-id="components.directives.content-item-base.overflowMenu.showMenu.button"><span class="MuiIconButtonlabel-0-2-364"><svg class="MuiSvgIconroot-0-2-336 makeStylesdirectionalIcon-0-2-335 makeStylesstrokeIcon-0-2-334 MuiSvgIconfontSizeSmall-0-2-343" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation"><path fill="currentColor" stroke="transparent" d="M0 8c0-1.1046.8954-2 2-2s2 .8954 2 2-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2zM6 8c0-1.1046.8954-2 2-2s2 .8954 2 2-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2zM14 6c-1.1046 0-2 .8954-2 2s.8954 2 2 2 2-.8954 2-2-.8954-2-2-2z"></path></svg></span></button><div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-content-id="_55105957_1" class="root content-list-item makeStylescontentListItem-0-2-308" style="touch-action: manipulation;"><div class="makeStylesitemContainer-0-2-311 itemContainer"><div class="click-to-invoke-container makeStylescontentItem-0-2-312 makeStylesclickable-0-2-313"><div class="makeStylescontentItemComponent-0-2-322"><div class="makeStylescontentItemComponentDetailsGuts-0-2-323"><div class="makeStylescontentTitleLine-0-2-324"><div class="makeStylescontentItemIcon-0-2-331 makeStylescontentItemIcon-0-2-321" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="MuiSvgIconroot-0-2-336 makeStylesdirectionalIcon-0-2-335 makeStylesstrokeIcon-0-2-334 MuiSvgIconcolorPrimary-0-2-337" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" ro